  "prefLabel": "Res 7303.06 Digging",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Res 7303.06 Digging. No person shall dig holes on sand beaches unless all resulting holes are completely filled in prior to leaving the site. Digging holes to a depth greater than 12 inches shall not be permitted.\n\nSource. #8532, eff 1-1-06; ss by #10532, eff 3-1-14",
